{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "027c0bdd80c759db8c9d430b89eb4c22d97c79209652a5a15f70bb31eec09f70", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}さん！\nこんなところにいたんですね。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生！\n原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "78fb4937edf1a05b631fb2181723380f092ec98d11c50801e0d8100cc74001c0", "ja": "すみません、青羽さん、\nちょっと資料を探していたもので……。", "zh": "抱歉，青羽小姐，\n我刚刚在找资料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "7d389b643942c675ebf86dec11d803304e5e5eaa400118ec835dee77dcb7c2c5", "ja": "双眼鏡よりも先に{$P$}さんが\n見つかっちゃいました。えへへっ。", "zh": "没想到还没找到望远镜，\n就先找到{$P$}先生了，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e0562ad20bb4a1e2d0258eb3f2d61d99d6595038d12b31a3d16053a35dcbe915", "ja": "双眼鏡？", "zh": "望远镜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "ae13253f3259d0f680aa5a1928dfa6e5a9d42ec940970cd75d863958823022c7", "ja": "いえ、こっちの話です！\nそれより、また社長さんがお呼びでしたよ♪", "zh": "没什么，我在自言自语而已！\n对了，社长又有事情要找你啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "da53df85a6126f895820f935cae4e976bd908096f43a79571911a818e8b87d75", "ja": "ありがとうございます。今日は何だろうな……。\nよし、それじゃあ、行ってきますね。", "zh": "谢谢。今天不知道有什么事……\n好，那我出发了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "6f0d33402f4a807da1389c7ff7fc8867b9c5579214b9bec67b232dd36f862ab8", "ja": "はーい。\nお気をつけて～！", "zh": "好──\n路上小心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "29bb5765c934bc5ac94a037ace9e213f36c8f5efb9f691ba5f8cec2632695c24", "ja": "お疲れ様です！　あ、音無さん、\n社長に呼ばれて来たんですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了！啊，音无小姐，\n是社长叫我来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "b6e1f8f64419446cde7892eab68ea5f9e7590f3c576c4b0be4d066ab73f0abbb", "ja": "もう、いっそデートとかじゃなくて、思い切って……\nああっ、だめよ小鳥！　そんなの大胆すぎるわ！", "zh": "干脆也别说什么约会了，不如豁出去……\n啊啊，不行啦小鸟！那样也太大胆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2888a7a1497ae994ff0624638c2418e0311512d72f9dc8f49cc4b5744b211101", "ja": "あの、音無さん？", "zh": "不好意思，音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "543d38eb093012497041cb5b5404d3682c17e000095056ba147477929dd86220", "ja": "はっ！？　なな、{$P$}さん！？\nいいいいつからいたんですか！？", "zh": "啊！？什、什么，{$P$}先生！？\n你你你你什么时候来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4abf7ae44456f3ca7e004aa0aa23abe55b3a704e662ffc6ea3cf477a2436267d", "ja": "ついさっきからですけど、どうかしたんですか？\nなにか考え事でも？", "zh": "我也是刚到而已。\n怎么了？你在想事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "3883e43a2c89f05684daa6c8a4ed913c6906a19e466c2508fce6a21c36b4c4d8", "ja": "か、考え事っていう程でもないんですけど、\nその……流れ星に、何をお願いしようかなって。", "zh": "也、也不算想事情啦，\n我是在考虑……要对流星许什么愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "62eb8f1d89d29f096c13992e92da82e73ab0fd6430bcaae96fa731f8c922bae8", "ja": "流れ星って……何かありましたっけ？", "zh": "流星……怎么会说到流星？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "aa3895d726aab75aaf919f6bcb93d935c852353d9175a65665c282cab2f2539c", "ja": "あら、ご存じないんですか？　ふふ、週末にピークを\n迎えるっていう、ミリオン流星群のことです。", "zh": "哎呀，你不知道吗？\n呵呵，我是在说即将在这周末达到高峰的百万流星雨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c417fc1ec86c725482e74c39243cf70d7d90d3616c722f4be763499d12c23b06", "ja": "流星群か……なるほど、それで流れ星なんですね。", "zh": "流星雨吗……原来如此，所以才会讲到流星啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "359ef69ab9b8f2553a299e510c2efe4922f9d2f66317b4a6a79886e3dc791a44", "ja": "はい♪　流れ星にお祈りすれば……なんて、\nもちろん本気で信じてるわけじゃないですけど……。", "zh": "是的♪对流星许愿就能实现愿望……开玩笑的，\n我当然也不是真的很相信啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "440fecd42dc24c425a2e9d2af2fb62b11fa5c03be481c303431e30cc07ad45b6", "ja": "でも、夢くらい見たっていいですよね？\nまさか、もうダメとか言われませんよね！？", "zh": "不过，有点梦想应该也没关系吧？\n别人会不会觉得我已经过了做梦的年纪了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "56cb2ba84c3d9f8ca555453330aaf5396c41e063f4355ac9bc36cc401efe4565", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だと思います！\n夢、どんどん見ていきましょう！", "zh": "我、我觉得没问题的！\n梦想越多越好啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "67fb5d58ca8737aaca525aa3657e7d5c5e6306bddb922913dd25f5e8336a6d0d", "ja": "おや、君、もう来ていたのかね。\nうんうん、夢は大いに見るべきだね！", "zh": "哎呀，你已经来了啊。\n嗯嗯，梦想就应该要远大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "54ac796428c8284301eb49280cb7b73b61c0c28c61564a1087ad086de6ed02c3", "ja": "あ、社長、おはようございます！", "zh": "啊，社长早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "5b1e29e6c5153af561b9c5c21445583aea995f81ca9ac1f17b494bb4d83be295", "ja": "おはよう！　夢といえば他でもない。君には引き続き、\n夢のような公演をしてもらいたいと思っている！", "zh": "早安！说到梦想自然就要提到，\n我希望你能继续举办梦一般的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "46dc2c55f20abac15e71be0c080570fd61d0ceef6d3110dace9aa8e503740acf", "ja": "では、今日の用件というのは、もしかして……？", "zh": "那么，今天找我来难不成就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "2d74bed1caf6925e5074db909b36457a211480ea66c71ae1b2df407e01ac0634", "ja": "もしかしなくても、天体モチーフ公演の第三弾！　\n『Starlight Melody!』公演のことだ！", "zh": "不用怀疑，就是为了天体概念公演的第三波！\n『Starlight Melody!』公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "f05849945055b86b30b20a0e526e55e69b6591c28d0e577e63bee67163394e32", "ja": "まあ、君のことだから、抜かりはないと思うが……\n敢えて聞こう。どうかね、準備の方は？", "zh": "毕竟负责人是你，我想应该是不会有问题……\n但我还是问一下，准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "09bd6ca0906c392dfc83423e13029db021214beff16d1a7e208bfde887c9f472", "ja": "抜かりなく！", "zh": "完全没有问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "85652b8f1930d29139be7507b92ac66e338eb9750bf8c21d18f92b019979e6e6", "ja": "もちろん、抜かりなく準備は整えています！\nではさっそく、計画を実行に移しますね。", "zh": "当然已经做好万全的准备！\n那我就马上开始实行计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "74f594302f77c82421115c7364ff1bef4ec4629e2cbcbd019cdab74d9598f93f", "ja": "はっはっはっはっは！　いや、さすがだよ君！\nでは今回もひとつ、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈哈！真是太佩服你啦！\n那么，这次也交给你啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "01778322c178da8a895ea87fbac9c3c32c6dbdba0abc58556d5789aceb713cb8", "ja": "そうだ！　本当に夢のような公演になるように、\n私もお星さまにお祈りしておきます♪", "zh": "对了！我也会跟星星许愿，\n希望能办成一场如梦似幻的公演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f94907e76bdcaf99ad4b3f78e80276eb8d6fcaec657ef65380c9256c8095ad22", "ja": "……ありがとうございます、音無さん。\nその願いをかなえられるように、がんばります！", "zh": "……谢谢你，音无小姐。\n我会努力让这个愿望成真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "3e72ffbc09d2e802c719392b995740ce04583d197b3e63c354d62516964de5b0", "ja": "（天体モチーフ公演の第三弾……。\nまた新しいメンバーで行う事になる）", "zh": "（天体概念公演的第三波……\n又要换新的成员来演出了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "202a813f89573cdf577b96b319f7cd9e4cab94614eef2bc73c0ffe98fa77f8d2", "ja": "（この『Starlight Melody!』公演を成功させて\n劇場の可能性を宇宙に広げて行こう！）", "zh": "（我要办好『Starlight Melody!』这场公演，\n把剧场的可能性拓展到宇宙！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
